    "sixFlags": "0x50668b..0x5066cd compares leftY+0x539,rightY+0x53d,leftX+0x541,rightX+0x545,centerX+0x531,centerY+0x535 against0. ANY zero takes message path0x5066cd then jumps0x506a41;nonzero continuation begins0x5066fc before source resolution0x50670f and numerical construction. The full0x506664..0x506a65capture includes prologue,SEH cleanup/epilogue andreturn;rejection skips numerical/result continuation and the later direct+0x571clear/window-control calls on the success path. No scalar/coordinate erasure inferred from the rejection.",
    "pairedPan": "Active pan failure writes both shoulder Xflags0 at0x50ac54..0x50ac64 or0x50ae2c..0x50ae3c,retaining numeric scalars/Y;this known zero state must not enter the width computation path.",
    "center": "0x5096e8/0x5096ee store centerX/Y from coordinates.0x507849..0x5078b3sets Xorigin0,width500 and upperpane0..125. Manual C=(paneBottom-Y)/100 from0x509a63..0x509af8makes upper sampled top C1.25correspond to globalY0. Exact shared pane boundaries elsewhere and rounded nearzero rows/columns are not established by continuous projection.",
